        "title": "01 - Prehistoric and Ancient Art",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**What these are not**: direct windows onto \"primitive\" thinking. The execution requires\nplanning, material preparation (grinding pigment, mixing binder), knowledge of animal\nanatomy, and the cognitive capacity to project a 3D animal onto a 2D surface in the dark\nby firelight. Scaffolding evidence at Lascaux confirms organized labor."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-PREHISTORIC-ANCIENT.md#016",
      "path": [
        "01-PREHISTORIC-ANCIENT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:art-history:01-prehistoric-ancient, git-history:art-history:01-prehistoric-ancient]",
